  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsible practices in the ASM Peruvian and Colombian gold sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project promotes a Shared-Value model between ASM/LSM, as a mechanism to improve working conditions for Artisanal Small Scale Gold Miners, their mining practices, and to progress towards their formalization. In 2021, we supported 735 small scale miners, and improved working conditions for 269 workers through better access to social security, reduced exposure to mercury, and improved health and safety conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
